{"4657830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witch You!", "steam_appid": 4657830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person <strong>co-op</strong> game where, as a pair of witches and apothecaresses, you must manage your apothecary and restore it from the neglect of its former owners. <strong><i>Witch You</i></strong><i> </i>is a <strong>roguelike management game: customize the shop, upgrade it, and survive as many days as possible before the apothecary is shut down</strong>. Travel to <strong>Dante</strong>’s very own <strong>Hell</strong> to obtain the ingredients needed to create unique potions for your customers and thus keep the shop running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Oh, and one small detail... NO ONE, except your beloved devilish pet, V, can know that you are witches. If you were ever discovered... everyone knows what the Holy Inquisition is capable of.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/extras/d0191d3a362b8ee4f51e1a68592e0869.avif?t=1779303036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/extras_big/d0191d3a362b8ee4f51e1a68592e0869.avif?t=1779303036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person <strong>co-op</strong> game where, as a pair of witches and apothecaresses, you must manage your apothecary and restore it from the neglect of its former owners. <strong><i>Witch You</i></strong><i> </i>is a <strong>roguelike management game: customize the shop, upgrade it, and survive as many days as possible before the apothecary is shut down</strong>. Travel to <strong>Dante</strong>’s very own <strong>Hell</strong> to obtain the ingredients needed to create unique potions for your customers and thus keep the shop running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Oh, and one small detail... NO ONE, except your beloved devilish pet, V, can know that you are witches. If you were ever discovered... everyone knows what the Holy Inquisition is capable of.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/extras/d0191d3a362b8ee4f51e1a68592e0869.avif?t=1779303036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/extras_big/d0191d3a362b8ee4f51e1a68592e0869.avif?t=1779303036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person co-op game where, as witches, you must run your own apothecary. Witch You is a roguelike management game: customize your shop, upgrade it, and survive as many days as possible without getting shut down, all while traveling to a Dantesque Hell to restock your supplies.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Catalan", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/9c934d9987ab6f7ed11ba1ed6c4e4270e5ce8a65/header.jpg?t=1779303036", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/08519ff3a6e7ad8844a9eb83c7084096df4671ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779303036", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657830/08519ff3a6e7ad8844a9eb83c7084096df4671ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779303036", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1 64-bit or Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8300H CPU @ 2.30GHz   2.30 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>